<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Inland Steel said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Inland Steel said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette upgraded Inland Steel Industries Inc to market perform from underperform, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/2 to 16-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
